WEBVTT

00:02:27.676 --> 00:02:30.716
punctuated by clouds and storm formations.

00:02:31.036 --> 00:02:34.916
The most beautiful tapestry
the girl has ever seen.

00:02:35.516 --> 00:02:37.196
“Father,” she whispers,

00:02:37.196 --> 00:02:38.996
although he's been dead two years.

00:02:39.396 --> 00:02:42.716
“Father, the world itself is a weave,

00:02:42.716 --> 00:02:44.196
a living garment.”

00:02:45.556 --> 00:02:49.396
Slowly, they fall through the air

00:02:49.396 --> 00:02:52.276
and then they see ...

00:02:52.276 --> 00:02:57.196
a vast swath of forest
veined and spotted with fire,

00:02:57.196 --> 00:03:01.836
a gray wall of water
crashing down on a bleak shore,